# ============================================================
#  Factions (design §3.2): who wants what. alignment: lean on the
#  Lumen (+) ↔ Hollow (−) axis · stance: toward the player at the
#  start of a run.
# ============================================================

@faction wardens
name: The Wardens
members: isolde thorne maud
alignment: 60
stance: neutral
desc: The headmistress's quiet circle, sworn to keep the founders' seal. They recruit students only when the seal grows thin.

@faction hollow_cult
name: The Hollow Cult
members: ilse
alignment: -80
stance: hostile
desc: Northern families, the Dumonts first among them, who serve the star beneath the lake. Their messenger is the man in grey.

@faction midnight_cartographers
name: The Midnight Cartographers
members: corvin
alignment: 0
stance: neutral
desc: The club that doesn't exist: students who map the castle's secret passages and share them with almost no one.

@faction faculty
name: The Faculty
members: isolde thorne maud
alignment: 30
stance: neutral
desc: The professors and staff of Lumenhold: strict, eccentric, and mostly on your side whether you like it or not.

@faction conclave
name: The Conclave of the Seven Towers
alignment: 20
stance: neutral
desc: The governing body of magic in the realm, headquartered in the capital. Hands out research posts, licences and very long letters.

@faction thornwick
name: Thornwick Academy
alignment: 0
stance: hostile
desc: The rival school across the hills. Famous for illusionists, tournament grudges and spies who think they're subtle.
